<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>IcantTapstrafe</Major>
    <Description>Hey everyone! ive made a macro for you which allows you to Automatically move while your on a deathbox,

Here is how to use it;
1, bind this macro to the button you sprint with,
2, hold your sprint button while your on a deathbox, 
3. enjoy,

I prefer to test the macro in the Firing range to get used to it!!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
